## KEF Encryption Format 
...for air-gapped end-to-end encryption


???

Thank you Vinteum -- and attendees, for traveling the world, and coming together for this event.

Who am I?
Jean Do is a nym I use for contributing to FOSS freedom tools,
It's a play on the proper nown "John Doe" -- a person unknown, male, except with a french accent pronounced like "Jean Do" ou zhee-day, or JD, or Jean, or John, or even Gene works.  The github username is `jdlcdl`, inspired by Jean's email address jean.dominique.lecomte.delisle@proton.me.

A disclaimer: I am NOT a cryptologist... but if YOU ARE then please raise your hand so that others can see, and so they may may approach you about any content presented here.  Beyond this disclaimer, whether we admit it or not, I'll argue that wwe're all effectively cryptographers, in that we're practitioners of applied-cryptography.


